      "description": "Lag read from the BROKER's __consumer_offsets by kafka-exporter \u2014 not from the consumer's own client metrics. This matters: client-side lag metrics vanish when the consumer dies, which is exactly the failure you want the dashboard to catch. Broker-side lag keeps climbing and stays visible."
